==German==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|goh|de}} {{term|spiwan|spīwan|lang=goh}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|de}} {{recons|spīwanan|lang=gem-pro}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈʃpaɪ̯ən/|lang=de}}
* {{audio|De-speien.ogg|Audio}}

===Verb===
{{de-verb-strong|class=1|speit|spie|gespien}}

# to [[spit]]
# (euphemism) to [[vomit]]

====Conjugation====
The past participle currently has two different pronunciations: one corresponding to {{term|gespien}} and the other to {{term|gespieen}}.  Formerly, the spelling {{term||gespieen}} was an acceptable alternative.  Today, though, the only correct spelling is '''{{term||gespien}}''', regardless of pronunciation.

